# YouTube Data API v3 key — enables live karaoke video search.
# Get a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/youtube.googleapis.com
# Enable the "YouTube Data API v3" and create an API key.
# Without this key the app falls back to the built-in mock catalog.
# NOTE: put your real key in .env.local (gitignored), NOT here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=YOUR_YOUTUBE_API_KEY